<title>USA: Ameritech cuts telephone rates in Ohio.</title>
<headline>Ameritech cuts telephone rates in Ohio.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp said Thursday it would reduce rates for its Ohio customers and make its touch-tone service free for local telephone users as part of its &quot;Advantage Ohio&quot; program.</p>
<p>The company said the rate reduction would save customers about $14 million in 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day, Ameritech launched a dial-up Internet access service called Ameritech.net in Chicago, Detroit and Cleveland.</p>
